<th id="S4.T2.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">MAE-style</th>
<td id="S4.T2.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">0.812</td>
